## 📚 QUICK REFERENCE

**Before creating a file**:
- Is it a core file? → Check MASTER-RULES-WORKFLOW.mdc (Part 1.5)
- Is it documentation/summary/plan? → Require explicit user request
- Unsure? → ASK USER FIRST

**Before git operation**:
- Verify branch aligns with task requirements
- Verify files (core files only)
- Get explicit user approval
- Never assume permission

**Before completing work**:
- Verify all checklist items
- Verify branch and files
- Verify user approval obtained
- Verify no rules violated
- Verify feature branch deleted and PR closed

