- ✅ Stage ALL fixes together: `git add <all-fixed-files>`
- ✅ Commit ALL fixes together: Single commit with all corrections
- ✅ Push ONCE after all fixes: `git push origin feature/<branch-name>`
- ✅ **NEVER**: Multiple commits/pushes for fixes (batches into one)
- ✅ **RESULT**: Clean git history, minimal pushes, clean build tree
